{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">AI技術席捲全球，各國積極開發自家科技產品。土耳其自家生產的人形機械人Canik Man，近日在東南部城市尚勒烏爾法(Şanlıurfa)的航太科技節(TECKNOFEST)一展身手。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"&lt;br&gt;  margin: 0 0 4px 0; &lt;br&gt;  border-radius: 8px; &lt;br&gt;  overflow: hidden;&lt;br&gt;  background: #fff;&lt;br&gt;  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;&lt;br&gt;\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"><br/> <img alt=\"1007 TURK.ROBOT - 截图5\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/4df2434ddb1c4abc991a8a67789d604d/snapshots/820938a15bd7499f878f8fe909279d03-00005.jpg\" style=\"&lt;br&gt;        width: 100%; &lt;br&gt;        max-width: 100%; &lt;br&gt;        height: auto;&lt;br&gt;        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; &lt;br&gt;        display: block;&lt;br&gt;        object-fit: contain;&lt;br&gt;      \" title=\"视频 1007 TURK.ROBOT 的第5张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Canik Man戴上當地傳統頭巾，造型獨特。它隨著音樂拍手起舞，又為現場觀眾送上飛吻，成為全場焦點。現場不少兒童排隊，輪流跟機械人拍照留念。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T04:39:39.949758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}